00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.630
Hello and welcome. My name is Inez Gutierrez and I want to

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:06.340
personally thank you for taking the time to learn about Welcome

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.450
to America. Like so many people, I've experienced challenges

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.890
that completely changed the direction of my life. Those

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:16.100
experiences taught me something very important that everyone

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.430
deserves someone who believes in them, someone who can guide

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:23.390
them, and someone who genuinely cares. That's why Welcome to

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.000
America was created.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.100
Our mission is simple, to help individuals and families

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.550
successfully navigating life in the United States. Starting

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.940
over a new country can be overwhelming. There are questions

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:38.030
about immigration, health care, education, employment, and

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:41.280
understanding systems that may be completely unfamiliar. It can

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.460
feel intimidating, especially when you don't even know where to

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.000
turn.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.100
At Welcome to America, we want you to know that you are not

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.700
alone. We believe every person deserves access to trust through

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.450
the information, compassionate guidance, and a community that

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.000
is ready to support them.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.920
Whether you're taking the first steps towards building a new

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.870
life or simply need understanding the resources available to

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:06.480
you, we're here to walk alongside you. Our goal isn't just to

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:10.000
provide services. Our goal is to build relationships.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.380
We believe that people are given the right tools, the right

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:16.580
support, and the right opportunities. They can create

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:19.000
incredible futures for themselves and for their families.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.190
Every day, we work with individuals from different backgrounds,

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:25.480
cultures, and life experiences. Every story is unique, and

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:29.060
every person deserves to be treated with dignity, respect, and

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.000
compassion.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.840
Welcome to America is more than just an organization. It's a

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:37.680
community. It's a place where questions are welcomed, where

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.000
people are heard, and where hope begins to grow.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.100
As we continue to expand our programs and services, our

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:47.350
commitment remains the same to empower people, strengthen

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.870
families, and connect our communities with the resources they

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:52.000
need to thrive.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.920
Thank you for trusting us to be part of your journey. Whether

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.950
you're looking for guidance, support, or simply just a place to

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:00.000
start, we're honored to welcome you.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Welcome to America. We're glad you're here.

